{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 30 August 2024, the proposed use of 541 Great West Road TW5 0BS as a Children's Care Home (Use Class C2) was not lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) because:\r\nThe applicant has failed to submit sufficient information to demonstrate that the proposal would not result in a material change of use of the site under Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\nThe current use of the property as a large House in Multiple Occupation is unauthorised and requires planning permission. "
